      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this needs a proposal for the change in behavior (even if it is an improvement).  Because it is in crypto/ssh, my snap reaction is also \"are we sure there are no security implications here?\"\n\nSee https://go.dev/s/proposal\n\nIf there\u0027s already been a proposal and I missed it, add the bug number to the \ncommit message.\n\nSorry for the hiccup, but, these details matters.",
